== Effects ==
* Grants the following effects for the current room:
** Increases Isaac's sprite size and hitbox by 60%. Hitbox cannot be increased past the standard value.
** +7 flat [[damage]].
** {{dlc|nr}} +30 [[range]].
** {{dlc|r}} +3 [[range]].
** Allows Isaac to walk over [[obstacles]] to destroy them.

== Notes ==
* Being a [[special card]], Huge Growth has a significantly lower chance of appearing compared to other cards.
* This effect doesn't stack if used multiple times in the same room.
* To unlock, Isaac must be 3 times bigger than his starting size.
** Isaac's total size is taken into account in unlocking Huge Growth; any size downs, such as [[Pills|One Makes You Small]] pills and {{I|Binky}}, will hinder progression towards the unlock.
** {{T|Liberty Cap}} will count towards this when the {{I|Magic Mushroom}} effect is active.
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}} causes {{P|XI - Strength}} to count for 2 size increases.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

== Trivia ==
* Huge Growth has been added in [[Booster Pack #1]], after the initial release of the DLC.
* Huge Growth is based on [http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=841401139 this Steam Workshop mod] by aeiou.
* Huge Growth is a reference to the card [http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=153 Giant Growth] from Magic: The Gathering. The quote is a reference to the card [http://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=456753 Become Immense], which has a similar effect to Giant Growth, both making a creature larger.

